[{:db/id 17592186124556 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-5ea54c52-c613-575d-9b4a-ae98c73f35ea"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-5ea54c52-c613-575d-9b4a-ae98c73f35ea" :question/id #uuid "5ea54c52-c613-575d-9b4a-ae98c73f35ea" :question/math-academy-id "q-35926" :question/problem "The projection of the intersection between the hyperbolic paraboloid $12z=4(x+2)^{2}-3{y}^{2}$ and the plane \n$z=1$  onto the $xy$-plane is a hyperbola. What are the lengths of the semi-axes of the hyperbola?" :question/worked-solution "To find the intersection of the paraboloid and the plane $z=1$, we substitute $z=1$ into the equation of the paraboloid, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12z & =4(x+2)^{2}-3{y}^{2} \\\\ 12(1) & =4(x+2)^{2}-3{y}^{2} \\\\ 12 & =4(x+2)^{2}-3{y}^{2} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{3}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{2}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbola with semi-axes of lengths $\\sqrt{3}$ and $2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8a4ae1c8-63c4-5962-bc3f-7d5f1634e01e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8a4ae1c8-63c4-5962-bc3f-7d5f1634e01e" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a4ae1c8-63c4-5962-bc3f-7d5f1634e01e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3a2b823c-f5c0-585b-b3ff-0eec4bcfc2e2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9e786335-093c-5020-9d1b-5216151e0ab3" "answer-31103cb3-8db8-5966-8f8f-150d81076c20" "answer-3a2b823c-f5c0-585b-b3ff-0eec4bcfc2e2" "answer-ce083963-6a81-5daf-90c1-ac994c70d5be" "answer-019726e7-4913-502a-a919-de71561128cf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9e786335-093c-5020-9d1b-5216151e0ab3" :answer/id #uuid "9e786335-093c-5020-9d1b-5216151e0ab3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3$ and $2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-31103cb3-8db8-5966-8f8f-150d81076c20" 